<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>

  <!--
    🔴 FROZEN 2026-09-24 — carrying the world until the terminal paint; content lives in
    `mandrake.rm.therot`; do not edit here.

    RUT_TheRot                                     UtinniPatches - authored 2026-09-09
    BIOME_OWNERSHIP_WAVE_1. Full sheet: design/Jawa/worldbuilding/biomes/the_rot.md
    (FROZEN). Replaces the donor `AB_MycoticJungle` (Alpha Biomes' "Mycotic
    Jungle"). Sheet-named "THE ROT" (owner's pick).

    MEASURED live on V25 (sheet SS0, post cold-tail repaint 2026-09-08): 2,258 tiles,
    arc 74-135, temp p10/median/p90 -35.5/-18.8/+12.9 C.

    ROT_SHEEN_WEATHER_1 (this pass): baseWeatherCommonalities below now points at
    our own RUT_SheenFall/RUT_SheenStorm/RUT_SheenMist WeatherDefs
    (RotSporeKit/Defs/WeatherDefs/RUT_RotSporeKit_SheenWeathers.xml — full clones of
    Rain/RainyThunderstorm/FoggyRain, same commonality numbers, rainRate kept so
    fires still douse) in place of the donor rows, closing ban 3's live text
    violation ("No water rain — a water-rain weather def here is a violation").
    RUT_SheenExposureLock (biomeMapConditions below) is the permanent condition
    that turns those weathers into the exposure ladder (RUT_SheenCoating ->
    RUT_SporeFlesh); full mechanism in that GameConditionDef's own header.

    diseaseMtbDays/animalDensity/plantDensity(plant density trimmed from donor's 0.2
    — see below) match the donor's read-in values (sheet SS0 "Donor inventory taken
    in"). plantDensity: donor dump showed 0.2; kept close (0.6 chosen mid-range, see
    Owed) is NOT grounded in a sheet number — flagged: the sheet gives no explicit
    plantDensity figure, and "dense beyond anything dayside... this is the
    nightside's lush" (SS2) argues for HIGH density on a fungal-jungle read. Left at
    an interim value pending a quicktest tune, same pattern RUT_TheScald/RUT_GreySea
    used for their animalDensity.

    wildAnimals/wildPlants: transplanted from BiomeCast_Ashkarr.xml /
    BiomeFlora_Ashkarr.xml against rosters/the_rot.json. Ban 1 (no conventional
    plants) and ban 2 (no pure-animal residents, hybrid-or-out) are roster-level
    bans already enforced by that JSON.

    NOT this pass's scope: the heat-generating gene (still unauthored, SS Owed); the
    live-tea/symbiont mechanics (storage ban 4); the pale-tree anima reskin.

    UPDATE (FUNGALFOREST_RAID_MERGE_1, offline half, this pass): the wildPlants list
    below now points at our own `RUT_`-prefixed flora
    (`src/RimUtinni/RotSporeKit/Defs/ThingDefs_Plants/RUT_RotSporeKit_Flora.xml`)
    instead of the donor's `BMT_`-prefixed defs, per the ingestion ruling in
    `the_rot.md` §7b. wildAnimals was UNCHANGED at the time of this note (still
    donor `BMT_`/`AA_` defNames, MayRequire'd) — fauna admission was a separate
    sitting, `BIOME_FAUNA_ASSIGNMENT_SITTING_1`. CORRECTION (ROT_ROSTER_DEAD_DONOR_NAMES_1,
    2026-09-21): wildAnimals below has since been reconciled — every dead `BMT_`
    name was renamed to its owned `RSW_`/active-donor equivalent or dropped; none
    remain. The 425-tile `BMT_FungalForest` -> biome-merge
    repaint itself (the other half of that item) has NOT happened yet — still owed,
    gated on the owner reviewing the offline render this pass produced.
  -->

  <BiomeDef>
    <defName>RUT_TheRot</defName>
    <label>the Rot</label>
    <description>A pale fungal continent on the night shoulder of the stormwall: bone-white and lilac towers under a black sky, a glow-moss floor warm to lie on while the air above it would kill you, milky ponds that are not water. Nothing here is a plant. Nothing here is quite an animal. Everything is connected, everything is warm from the inside, and everything -- including what you take away with you -- is still alive.</description>
    <workerClass>RimMandrake.TheRot.RM_BiomeWorker_TheRot</workerClass>  <!-- was AlphaBiomes.BiomeWorker_MycoticJungle; Alpha Biomes retired 2026-10-18. A worker scores tiles only at worldgen, which this frozen world never runs. -->
    <foragedFood>RawFungus</foragedFood>
    <allowRoads>true</allowRoads>
    <allowRivers>true</allowRivers>
    <allowFarmingCamps>true</allowFarmingCamps>
    <animalDensity>1.9</animalDensity>
    <plantDensity>0.6</plantDensity>
    <forageability>0.5</forageability>
    <movementDifficulty>1</movementDifficulty>
    <texture>World/Biomes/RUT_TheRot</texture>
    <diseaseMtbDays>35</diseaseMtbDays>
    <diseases>
      <li>
        <diseaseInc>RM_Disease_SporeAllergy</diseaseInc>
        <commonality>100</commonality>
      </li>
      <li>
        <diseaseInc>RM_Disease_AnimalSporeAllergy</diseaseInc>
        <commonality>100</commonality>
      </li>
      <li>
        <diseaseInc>Disease_Flu</diseaseInc>
        <commonality>100</commonality>
      </li>
      <li>
        <diseaseInc>Disease_Plague</diseaseInc>
        <commonality>100</commonality>
      </li>
      <li>
        <diseaseInc>Disease_GutWorms</diseaseInc>
        <commonality>80</commonality>
      </li>
      <li>
        <diseaseInc>Disease_MuscleParasites</diseaseInc>
        <commonality>80</commonality>
      </li>
      <li>
        <diseaseInc>Disease_FibrousMechanites</diseaseInc>
        <commonality>30</commonality>
      </li>
      <li>
        <diseaseInc>Disease_SensoryMechanites</diseaseInc>
        <commonality>30</commonality>
      </li>
      <li>
        <diseaseInc>Disease_AnimalFlu</diseaseInc>
        <commonality>100</commonality>
      </li>
      <li>
        <diseaseInc>Disease_AnimalPlague</diseaseInc>
        <commonality>100</commonality>
      </li>
    </diseases>
    <terrainsByFertility>
      <li>
        <terrain>RM_TheRotGrass</terrain>
        <min>-999</min>
        <max>0.87</max>
      </li>
      <li>
        <terrain>RM_TheRotSoilRich</terrain>
        <min>0.87</min>
        <max>999</max>
      </li>
    </terrainsByFertility>
    <baseWeatherCommonalities>
      <Clear>8</Clear>
      <RM_SheenFall MayRequire="mandrake.rm.biomes">10</RM_SheenFall>
      <DryThunderstorm>1</DryThunderstorm>
      <RM_SheenStorm MayRequire="mandrake.rm.biomes">10</RM_SheenStorm>
      <RM_SheenMist MayRequire="mandrake.rm.biomes">10</RM_SheenMist>
    </baseWeatherCommonalities>
    <biomeMapConditions>
      <li MayRequire="mandrake.rm.biomes">RM_SheenExposureLock</li>
    </biomeMapConditions>
    <wildAnimals>
      <RSW_FungalWeevil MayRequire="mandrake.rsw.swbestiary">0.4</RSW_FungalWeevil>  <!-- fungal weevil - ingest-strange, import -->
      <RSW_FungalMantis MayRequire="mandrake.rsw.swbestiary">0.15</RSW_FungalMantis>  <!-- fungal mimic mantis - guardian, import -->
      <!-- ECOSYSTEM_PYRAMID_LAW_1 (owner, 2026-09-20: "50% small"): this roster read
           35.9% small. Both additions are already OWNER-RULED members of this exact
           biome's fauna list (design/Jawa/worldbuilding/biomes/rosters/the_rot.json
           "fauna", 0.5 each) that were never wired — not invented. AA_AngelMoth
           (bodySize 0.75) and Snoruuk (bodySize 0.5, canonically a mobile mushroom —
           fits a fungal rot swamp directly) are both small. -->
      <RSW_Snoruuk MayRequire="mandrake.rsw.swbestiary">0.5</RSW_Snoruuk>  <!-- snoruuk - mobile mushroom, small, ruled -->
      <!-- ROT_ROSTER_DEAD_DONOR_NAMES_1 (this pass): the roster's remaining `BMT_`
           names were never a coverage gap — they are the owner's own 2026-09-10
           sitting ruling ("move" to the Rot, decisions_propagated.json) for species
           already ported into our own tier by BMT_FAUNA_ABSORPTION_1
           (RSW_BiomesTeamPort_Races.xml) or, for AA_AnimaColossus, already an active
           donor def (sarg.alphaanimals) that was simply never wired. Wiring under the
           OWNED name, not the dead `BMT_`/donor name. RSW_PustuleHornetQueen/
           RSW_ColonyPustuleHornetQueen/RSW_PustuleHornetSpawned are moved IN from
           RUT_Wasteland.xml (removed there in this same pass) per that same ruling —
           wasteland.json no longer admits them, so leaving them wired in both biomes
           would have doubled a species the owner moved. -->
      <RSW_PustuleHornetQueen MayRequire="mandrake.rsw.swbestiary">0.3</RSW_PustuleHornetQueen>  <!-- pustule queen - wretched-small, moved in from Wasteland -->
      <RSW_ColonyPustuleHornetQueen MayRequire="mandrake.rsw.swbestiary">0.2</RSW_ColonyPustuleHornetQueen>  <!-- colony pustule queen - wretched-small, moved in from Wasteland -->
      <RSW_PustuleHornetSpawned MayRequire="mandrake.rsw.swbestiary">0.2</RSW_PustuleHornetSpawned>  <!-- pustule hornet - wretched-small, moved in from Wasteland -->
      <RSW_ColonyPustuleHornet MayRequire="mandrake.rsw.swbestiary">0.5</RSW_ColonyPustuleHornet>  <!-- colony pustule hornet - import -->
      <RSW_PustuleHornet MayRequire="mandrake.rsw.swbestiary">0.5</RSW_PustuleHornet>  <!-- pustule hornet - import -->
      <RSW_SmogMoth MayRequire="mandrake.rsw.swbestiary">0.5</RSW_SmogMoth>  <!-- smog moth - flier, import -->
      <RSW_Thrumbungus MayRequire="mandrake.rsw.swbestiary">0.5</RSW_Thrumbungus>  <!-- thrumbungus - titan, import -->
      <RSW_Yooka MayRequire="mandrake.rsw.swbestiary">0.5</RSW_Yooka>  <!-- yooka - import -->
      <RSW_ShiroTrap MayRequire="mandrake.rsw.swbestiary">0.5</RSW_ShiroTrap>  <!-- shiro trap - floor-ambush, moved in from the Greentide's roster ruling -->
    </wildAnimals>
    <coastalWildAnimals />
    <wildPlants>
      <RM_Bryolux>10</RM_Bryolux>  <!-- bryolux -->
      <RM_Glowstool>3</RM_Glowstool>  <!-- glowstool -->
      <RM_TollukCap MayRequire="mandrake.rm.biomes">2</RM_TollukCap>  <!-- aumbri (replaces donor AB_Agarilux) -->
      <RM_GiantAgarilux>2</RM_GiantAgarilux>  <!-- giant agarilux -->
      <RM_GlowingAgarilux>1</RM_GlowingAgarilux>  <!-- glowing agarilux -->
      <RM_LilacBeacon>0.5</RM_LilacBeacon>  <!-- lilac beacon -->
      <RM_WitchesOyster>0.5</RM_WitchesOyster>  <!-- witches' oyster -->
      <RM_Dewshrooms MayRequire="mandrake.rm.biomes">0.5</RM_Dewshrooms>  <!-- dewshrooms - RUT_ (raided, FUNGALFOREST_RAID_MERGE_1) -->
      <RM_FruitingBodies MayRequire="mandrake.rm.biomes">0.5</RM_FruitingBodies>  <!-- mold fruiting bodies - RUT_ (raided) -->
      <RM_Nuitae MayRequire="mandrake.rm.biomes">0.5</RM_Nuitae>  <!-- nuitae - RUT_ (raided) -->
      <RM_Wrinklecap MayRequire="mandrake.rm.biomes">0.5</RM_Wrinklecap>  <!-- wrinklecap - RUT_ (raided) -->
      <RM_Arpeau MayRequire="mandrake.rm.biomes">0.4</RM_Arpeau>  <!-- arpeau - tree - RUT_ (raided) -->
      <!-- SHEET_ORPHAN_CONSUMPTION_1, owner review 2026-09-20: RUT_Nogtyl moved OUT to
           the_miasma and RUT_RustPuff moved OUT to the_contagion. Both rulings landed in
           rosters/the_rot.json and reached the game only through BiomeFlora_Ashkarr.xml's
           now-retired replace operation; transplanted here by
           BIOMEFLORA_PATCH_WIPES_WILDPLANTS_1. -->
      <RM_RecurvedStropharia>0.3</RM_RecurvedStropharia>  <!-- recurved stropharia -->
      <RM_FlakespireFungus MayRequire="mandrake.rm.biomes">0.3</RM_FlakespireFungus>  <!-- flakespire fungus - tree - RUT_ (raided) -->
      <RM_Pusmelon MayRequire="mandrake.rm.biomes">0.3</RM_Pusmelon>  <!-- pusmelon - RUT_ (raided) -->
      <RM_Sagecrust MayRequire="mandrake.rm.biomes">0.3</RM_Sagecrust>  <!-- sagecrust - RUT_ (raided) -->
      <RM_ArbuscularMycorrhiza>0.2</RM_ArbuscularMycorrhiza>  <!-- arbuscular mycorrhiza -->
      <RM_SlimyPholiota>0.2</RM_SlimyPholiota>  <!-- slimy pholiota -->
      <RM_BleedingTooth MayRequire="mandrake.rm.biomes">0.2</RM_BleedingTooth>  <!-- bleeding tooth - RUT_ (raided) -->
      <RM_Brightbell MayRequire="mandrake.rm.biomes">0.2</RM_Brightbell>  <!-- shinebell - RUT_ (raided); was BMT_Brightbells, a defName that never existed in the donor (real donor defName is singular BMT_Brightbell) - fixed on ingest -->
      <RM_CrimsonCap MayRequire="mandrake.rm.biomes">0.2</RM_CrimsonCap>  <!-- crimson cap - RUT_ (raided) -->
      <RM_GreyLady MayRequire="mandrake.rm.biomes">0.2</RM_GreyLady>  <!-- Grey Lady - RUT_ (raided) -->
      <RM_Shinecap MayRequire="mandrake.rm.biomes">0.2</RM_Shinecap>  <!-- shine cap - tree - RUT_ (raided) -->
      <RM_VioletWimple MayRequire="mandrake.rm.biomes">0.2</RM_VioletWimple>  <!-- violet wimple - RUT_ (raided) -->
      <RM_MortalMorelPlant MayRequire="mandrake.rm.biomes">0.15</RM_MortalMorelPlant>  <!-- mortal morel - RUT_ (raided) -->
      <RM_AgaricusDomeCap>0.1</RM_AgaricusDomeCap>  <!-- agaricus domecap -->
      <RM_DribblingCap>0.1</RM_DribblingCap>  <!-- dribbling cap -->
      <RM_Skulltop MayRequire="mandrake.rm.biomes">0.1</RM_Skulltop>  <!-- skulltop - tree - RUT_ (raided) -->
      <RM_BlastpodShroom MayRequire="mandrake.rm.biomes">0.05</RM_BlastpodShroom>  <!-- blastpod shroom - RUT_ (raided); wild-only per owner ruling 2026-09-06, no sow tags -->
      <RM_AgariluxPrime>0.01</RM_AgariluxPrime>  <!-- Agarilux Prime -->
    </wildPlants>
    <wildPlantRegrowDays>25</wildPlantRegrowDays>
    <!--
      ROT_DECAY_HARVEST_1 ("the gut digests"). Generic RM_-tier extension
      (defined in mandrake.rm.environmentalhazards, harmless on any biome that
      doesn't carry it) — see RM_AcceleratedRotExtension.cs for the field
      docs. No fields here: the item/corpse rate multipliers are a single Mod
      Settings dial, not per-biome (RM_EnvironmentalHazardsSettings.
      acceleratedRotItemMultiplier / acceleratedRotCorpseMultiplier).
    -->
    <!--
      ROT_WARM_MAT_1 (M3, "metabolic warmth"). Same generic RM_-tier idiom.
      The mat is the LIVING ground: the biome's own two natural terrains, plus
      the two RotSporeKit floors that are themselves mycelium. RUT_MushroomFloor
      and RUT_MoonlessCarpet are deliberately absent — they are dead material
      milled from the jungle, and flooring over the mat with dead material
      stopping the heat IS the trade the mechanic is built on.
      Warmth itself is one Mod Settings dial (RM_EnvironmentalHazardsSettings.
      warmGroundOffsetCelsius), not a per-biome field.
    -->
    <modExtensions>
      <li MayRequire="mandrake.rm.biomes" Class="RimMandrake.EnvironmentalHazards.RM_AcceleratedRotExtension" />
      <li MayRequire="mandrake.rm.biomes" Class="RimMandrake.EnvironmentalHazards.RM_WarmGroundExtension">
        <warmTerrains>
          <li>RM_TheRotGrass</li>  <!-- was AB_MycoticGrass (Alpha Biomes retired 2026-10-18) -->
          <li>RM_TheRotSoilRich</li>  <!-- was AB_MycoticSoilRich -->
          <li MayRequire="mandrake.rm.biomes">RM_MycelialSoil</li>
          <li MayRequire="mandrake.rm.biomes">RM_MycelialMatting</li>
        </warmTerrains>
      </li>
    </modExtensions>
  </BiomeDef>

</Defs>
